cucumberJsRunner.features.markdownDescription:
The `cucumberJsRunner.features` setting defines where the extension should look for `.feature` files.
Default value:
```json
{
  "cucumberJsRunner.features": [
    "features/**/*.feature"
  ]
}
```

cucumberJsRunner.env.markdownDescription:
The `cucumberJsRunner.env` setting defines environment variables that will be passed to the `cucumber-js` command.
Default value:
```json
{
  "cucumberJsRunner.env": {}
}
```

cucumberJsRunner.debugEnv.markdownDescription:
The `cucumberJsRunner.debugEnv` setting defines debug environment variables that will be passed to the `cucumber-js` command when debugging, alongside those specified in the `env` setting.
Default value:
```json
{
  "cucumberJsRunner.debugEnv": {}
}
```

cucumberJsRunner.cucumberExecutable.markdownDescription:
The `cucumberJsRunner.cucumberExecutable` setting defines the path to the `cucumber-js` command. Default value:
```json
{
  "cucumberJsRunner.cucumberExecutable": "./node_modules/.bin/cucumber-js"
}
```
